# =============================================================================
# Exhaustive .gitignore
# Sections: OS, editors/IDEs, Python, Node/JS, frontend frameworks, other
# languages, containers/infra, data/ML, secrets, logs/temp, project specifics.
# Rooted patterns (leading "/") are used for generic names like lib/ and build/
# so they do not hide source folders such as frontend/src/lib.
# =============================================================================

